---
// OcrPipeline component - How document scanning works, in plain English
---

<section id="ocr-pipeline" class="relative bg-[#09110c] py-24 border-t border-white/5 text-white">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 sm:px-8">

    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#4ade80] uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Document Scanning</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold text-white sm:text-4xl">
        How scanning a document works.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
        Point your Android phone at a paper document — the app does the rest. No manual typing required.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3-step flow -->
    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-3">

      <div class="relative rounded-2xl border border-white/8 bg-white/3 p-7">
        <div class="absolute -top-4 left-7 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#16a34a] text-sm font-bold text-white">1</div>
        <div class="text-3xl mt-2 mb-4">📸</div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-white">Scan or Upload</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Use the Android app to take a photo of the paper document, or drag and drop a PDF into the desktop app.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="relative rounded-2xl border border-white/8 bg-white/3 p-7">
        <div class="absolute -top-4 left-7 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#16a34a] text-sm font-bold text-white">2</div>
        <div class="text-3xl mt-2 mb-4">🔍</div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-white">App Reads the Form</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          The system automatically reads the student's name, LRN, birth date, and other details from the scanned image.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="relative rounded-2xl border border-white/8 bg-white/3 p-7">
        <div class="absolute -top-4 left-7 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#16a34a] text-sm font-bold text-white">3</div>
        <div class="text-3xl mt-2 mb-4">✅</div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-white">Record is Saved</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          The student record is saved to the school database and becomes instantly searchable from any teacher workstation.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- CTA Banner -->
    <div class="mt-12 rounded-2xl border border-white/8 bg-white/3 p-8 text-center">
      <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-white">Digitize 100+ records in minutes.</h3>
      <p class="mt-3 text-base text-slate-400 max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Instead of manually typing student information one by one, staff can scan whole stacks of documents quickly and accurately.
      </p>
      <a
        href="#downloads"
        class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center rounded-xl bg-[#16a34a] px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-md shadow-[#16a34a]/20 hover:bg-[#15803d] transition"
      >
        Get the App
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
